---
description: Each test builds its own objects and does not share static state
alwaysApply: true
---

# Self-contained tests

Each test builds the objects it needs. Do not share a static field, fixture, mapper, or connection across tests.

```csharp
// ❌ BAD
static readonly StatementMappings Mappings = new(...);

[Fact]
public void MapsSelect() => Mappings.Apply(select, Cell);

// ✅ GOOD
[Fact]
public void MapsSelect()
{
    var mappings = new StatementMappings(...);
    mappings.Apply(select, (name, value) => value);
}
```

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
const mappings = new StatementMappings(...);

// ✅ GOOD
it("maps a select", () => {
  const mappings = new StatementMappings(...);
});
```

```rust
// ❌ BAD
static MAPPINGS: LazyLock<StatementMappings> = ...;

// ✅ GOOD
let mappings = StatementMappings::new(entities, properties);
```
